# Answering a question with a photo: ANSWERS=scripts/duo-markdown.json HEX=kept scripts/duo tap <ref> scripts/duo-ask-photo-taps
# The reply box's + adds photos the way the page's message box does; with one in, Send as note and
# Answer light up before any words, and the box stays open while the picker is up.
launch hexvoice:///?tasks=md
wait 3
tap ask-card
wait 1
tap ask-own
wait 1
tap ask-add
wait 1
shoot ask-add-menu
tap Photos
wait 3
tap Photo
wait 1
tap Add
wait 2
shoot ask-photo-waiting
type ask-input This one
above-keyboard ask-input
shoot ask-photo-typed
tap ask-Answer
wait 1
shoot ask-photo-answered
